' v1.2 asks before a dismissal (`OnMenuDismiss`, `GetDismissConversation`;
' `preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`, Paradise Camp, the mercenary
' hired as in v12_keys_dialog). With him selected (Shift+Right), DISMISS on
' the menu asks "Do you really want to / dismiss me?" (`newburn?117-118`);
' "All right, you're staying with me" (`?119`, he is with the boss) keeps
' him; DISMISS again and "Yes" (`burn?496`) lets him go with what he
' carries. v0.9.1 let him go at once.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 72,152          ' the snake lying here
wait 150
uiclick 266,118
wait 10
esc
wait 10
clickon 106              ' the mercenary: the talk opens
wait 30
press down
press down               ' "Would you like to work for me?"
press space
wait 3
press space              ' the first answer lit
press down               ' "OK, you'll get snake"
press space              ' hired
wait 20
wait 20
press shift+right        ' Bret, alone
wait 5
menu 150,200
menuline 5               ' DISMISS
wait 10
snap dismiss_question
talkline 1               ' he stays
wait 10
menu 150,200
menuline 5               ' DISMISS
wait 10
talkline 2               ' Yes
wait 10
quit
